    "Add simulated camera motion to your footage to emulate a simple wiggle or a violent earthquake with motion blur while switching from one shot to the next.",
    "Explore these 15 Camera Shake Transition presets that hit with nearly literal impact. Find them via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
